{"version":1,"content":"<p>薛家燕和陳曼娜在無綫劇《十月初五的月光》，分別飾演朱莎嬌和萬朱莎華角色，2人在劇中的恩怨情仇令人留下深刻印象，陳曼娜在劇中的金句「我萬朱莎華最講道理㗎喇」流傳至今。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:48.519114+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T10:14:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T07:58:06.706816+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771179+00:00","content_hash":"753536106ccdee166e6e9919ba53de15b2c16740275a04dffde4675518e73a99","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}